@api = http://localhost:5100

### Danh sach san pham -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/products

### San pham khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/products/999

### Tao san pham hop le -> 201 Created + Location
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lap trinh gRPC",
  "description": "Tai lieu bai 5",
  "price": 80000
}

### Tao san pham loi -> 400 Bad Request
POST {{api}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "San pham loi",
  "description": "",
  "price": -1
}